<!-- Story Section -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="mb-5">
      <span class="label animate-on-scroll">The Beginning</span>
      <h2 class="headline-md mb-3 animate-on-scroll">A common problem, overlooked.</h2>
      <div class="divider animate-on-scroll"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="body-lg mb-5 animate-on-scroll">
      PickPod was created by Salim Khan after discovering a common yet overlooked challenge: the only time available for flossing was during his commute.
    </p>
    <p class="body-lg text-muted mb-5 animate-on-scroll">
      After months of dealing with cluttered cup holders filled with used floss picks, he recognized an opportunity for innovation. What started as a personal frustration became a mission to help busy professionals maintain their dental health without compromise.
    </p>
    <p class="body-lg text-muted animate-on-scroll">
      The result is PickPod—a thoughtfully designed solution for individuals who prioritize dental health but lack traditional flossing time. With dedicated compartments for fresh and used picks, PickPod brings organization and convenience to on-the-go oral care.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

